Global recovery's important engine - China News
"China’s economy demonstrated strong resilience in responding to the impact of the COVID-19 pandemic."
Recently, the market expectations show that the international community generally looks forward to China's future development.
In an interview with the newspaper, Juan-Spanish China expert and distinguished advisor to China Policy Watch, Julio Ríos, said that China is entering a new phase of epidemic control and that the dynamism of economic and social development will be further released.
Rio said that China has demonstrated its economic resilience and management level by effectively responding to various unexpected factors with its outstanding economic governance experience and measures, which fully reflects its economic vitality.
At the same time, China is firmly committed to expanding its opening up to the outside world, and the internal driving force of economic development is constantly strengthened, and state-owned enterprises and private enterprises are developing together.
Every year, two national conferences are held in China, where the representatives discuss the national development plan, the hot issues of the people's life in the parliament, and consolidate the consensus, the hearts and minds of the people, and the wisdom to add strength to China's development.
“Since the reform and opening-up, China has achieved long-term high-speed development, and has now entered the stage of high-quality development.
The international community looks to China for wisdom and Chinese programs, and for China's development to bring new opportunities to the world.
Rio said that China is currently striving to promote technological innovation, inject new impetus into economic and social development, "and the money invested, the talent trained, and the policy encouraged will make China continue to be full of vitality in the new five-year plan."
To Rios, economic reform is a daunting task for any country.
Under the leadership of the Communist Party of China, China has taken positive and proactive measures to stabilize the economy, both by leveraging the advantages of the market economy and the advantages of the socialist system.
The strategic basis for expanding domestic demand, strengthening financial support for the real economy, supporting the development of the private sector, small and medium-sized enterprises and manufacturing, adhering to innovative development, promoting employment, improving the income and living standards of the Chinese people, meeting the people's multi-level diversified consumption needs ... China is complete, accurate and comprehensively implementing the new development concept, striving to promote high-quality development, build a new development pattern, and will bring more growth opportunities to the world.
This year marks the 10th anniversary of the Belt and Road Initiative.
The economic recovery after the epidemic is a common goal of the international community.
China's economic development potential will continue to be released, and will bring more benefits to the world, and become an important engine for the global recovery.
Leyton said that he looks forward to furthering the Belt and Road cooperation’s important role in improving infrastructure levels of countries and strengthening connectivity among various fields, thus releasing greater momentum.
The article was published on the website of the Madrid Post.
(People's Daily Online reporter Yan Huan)
The fitness industry should shake off its trust crisis - China News Service
Another large fitness center "defaulted"?
Recently, the issue of fitness club members' rights protection has attracted public attention due to the well-known fitness institution Zhenjian Fitness.
After the Spring Festival, many members found that their stores were not in normal operation. Subsequently, rumors about the bankruptcy and running away of the institution caused the members to panic, and the public security and human resources departments intervened.
Finally, the relevant person in charge of the institution made a statement, promising to do their best to protect the legitimate rights and interests of employees and members. The incident was then finally settled.
Some fitness institutions temporarily closed their part-time stores due to operational problems. Why did some members think that "something was wrong" when they could wait for the problem to be solved?
The profound problem behind the fitness club member advocacy is the crisis of trust in the industry.
Traditional gyms in China generally adopt a prepaid model, and the bottom line of its development is to "earn money from users who do not come".
By selling pre-sale memberships to obtain cash flow, opening new stores continuously, it seems that it can be cyclical, but in fact it is eating the grain of the ox, and it is impossible to form a stable profit model.
The negative information about the industry, such as the gym runway, is being reported frequently, which has caused a strong shock to consumer confidence.
From the perspective of market prospects, the fitness center is naturally a good business with "profit".
The fitness trackers industry has been up and down, but it has always been a hotbed for capital.
The data shows that the heat is rising in the areas of textile consumption and the market continues to warm up.
Specifically to the fitness market, with the steady improvement in the living standards of residents, the concept of healthy living is deeply ingrained in people's hearts, and the fitness industry can be developed.
The better the situation is, the more the industry needs to pay attention to the quality of development.
However, some institutions are overly optimistic about the fitness market after the recovery of consumption. They are just out of the crisis and are eager to expand their businesses by investing all the funds in building new stores.
Undoubtedly, over the past few years due to the impact of the epidemic, many institutions have withdrawn from the market, and industry restructuring has occurred. Strong enterprises at this time choosing to increase their acquisition efforts and reposition themselves is not necessarily a missed opportunity.
However, if the fitness market is to enter the good cycle and move steadily to the long road, the industry must change its traditional model and change its business strategy.
Only by consolidating and improving the consumer's trust and security can we truly win the market and win the future.
In contrast, the current fitness industry needs to lower its head and optimize its services, and to do so by developing high-quality services to stabilize users.
First and foremost, it is through service that users will be retained.
The gym is a service industry, and its essence is to adhere to the "user-oriented" principle, and to focus on improving the quality of service.
Secondly, to improve user experience, it is necessary to rely on digital transformation.
For example, the current popular model of internet fitness gyms, where users pay per session and choose their own facilities.
At the same time, body data, movement data can be used effectively and can also meet social needs, enabling a complete service loop from online to offline.
Without private sales and large annual memberships, users’ concerns about gyms “running away” have been reduced, and their trust has also been improved.
In addition, we should actively explore diversified businesses.
Today, sports consumption is moving from single-service to scenario-based consumption, with fitness clubs poised to become new entry points for consumption. Products and services related to physical exercise such as supplements and fitness equipment may become new revenue sources, offering consumers more choices.
Jiang Tianxiang
Buy it at a discount!
Nanjing real estate market replicates the difference in price of the compensation of the rent - China News Network
Yangzhou Evening News (Jurnalist Ma Zhaobo) Yangzhou Evening News/Violet News reporter found in an interview on the 10th that the price of the mortgage agreement, which had not been seen for more than a decade, has returned to the Nanjing housing market. A property in Jiangbei New District claims that the mortgage price is compensated by the mortgage, and other properties are offered more than the previous discount before the sale, and developers are willing to exchange the house for the buyer and return the difference.
The "Guaranteed Value Agreement" conditions aren't few.
This residential project located in Jiangbei New District is called Baoji Yanzhong Cuiyun Tai and Mr. Sun, who came to view it last weekend, told reporters that he had noticed an announcement while touring the site.
The developer sent the pictures to the reporter, which showed that the developer promised that if the buyer purchased the property between February 1st and February 28th, the developer would exchange the property for another property with a better discount (limited to the same unit type, the same building, the same unit type, and the same property type of the same property) and refund the difference.
Mr. Sun said that the sales consultant said that this was actually a "price protection agreement", which was to make buyers feel at ease, not to worry that the developer would reduce the price to promote sales, "now I'm afraid that after I buy it, it will be reduced in price, so I don't want to go to the sales office to make trouble, but I don't want to be sad if I don't make trouble."
There are also many buyers who think that the "pre-sale agreement" is a "sedative" for buyers, but the conditions are not low.
Ms. Zheng, who is planning to buy a house in Jiangbei, said that the house with the same floor plan and in the same building and unit is the first choice of the buyer, and the number of houses that can be compared is very limited, so the threshold is still high.
Some buyers also believe that it is difficult for buyers to maintain their rights because of the asymmetry of information and the fact that they can not exclude additional concessions when selling.
It remains to be seen whether the buyers will stay.
The reporter found on the Nanjing online real estate website that the property was sold out in November last year with two towers of 252 units. The floor area of the units is 105 square meters, 114 square meters, and 129 square meters, and the sales price of the fully furnished units is 39,843 yuan per square meter.
However, two months later, the online real estate showed that the total number of unsold units of the project was 157 units, accounting for 62.3%, of which 8# building had 128 units, and the unsold units accounted for 113 units, and the 7# building had 124 units, of which 44 units were unsold, and the total number of sales was only 33 units, accounting for 13%.
Market participants note that “price protection agreements” were also in place in Nanjing in 2008.
In August of that year, the property in the Huexi Huang Mountain Road, Yokohama, in order to attract the eyes of buyers, launched a coupon insurance plan, which specifically promised that if the project's discount rate was increased within a year, the company would return the difference to the old owner.
Since then, in April 2011, nine other properties in Nanjing have also taken out part of their property commitments to pay the difference in price.
“The property market is warming up, and it needs a ‘strong heart’ at this time.
Senior real estate developer Shen Mr., who is an expert in property development, said that “price protection agreements” are also one of the marketing methods used by developers.
He believes that today developers need more confidence than buyers, and that the introduction of a price-fixing agreement is actually giving them a boost.
As for whether the buyer will stay, he said that it depends on the influence of multiple factors such as the regulation policy, the loan threshold, etc. and it is still to be observed.
Chinese rescue team continues rescue operations in Turkey, rescuing 4 people trapped - China News Service
China News Service, February 11 - According to the website of the Ministry of Emergency Management, on the 10th, the Chinese rescue team sent out 3 action teams and 45 rescue team members to rescue the trapped person in Turkey.
The two search and evaluation teams were sent to assess the 15 blocks of buildings on Wodabash Street.
So far, four people have been rescued, five people have been found, and 25 buildings have been severely damaged, with signs of life and risk assessments being carried out.
The rescue team will continue to carry out in-depth rescue operations, adapting the rescue force scientifically and according to the actual situation in the disaster area and the situation on the ground.
The rescue team obtained information on assistance requests through multiple channels such as embassies, local governments, and UN relief organizations, verified them through various means including online inquiries and on-site searches.
Introduce the current rescue environment and building collapse to the Chinese Hong Kong Rescue Team, and jointly carry out search operations.
Currently, it is jointly responsible for the regional coordination (SSC5) with the Italian rescue team, and sends 3 members to work in the 5th regional coordination center, communicating with the Italian, British, Serbian, Slovak, and Oman rescue teams to understand the work of the United Nations rescue organization and the rescue teams of various countries.
The rescue team continues to strengthen safety management and team security, in accordance with the principle of unified command, safety first, strengthen safety control at the rescue site, strengthen the discipline requirements for rescue work, and clearly define safety precautions.
We will continue to implement the rotation standby and guard post work system and strengthen the security management of the camp.
The medical staff of the rescue team provide medical services to the team every day, strengthen the medical protection of key personnel, and currently the health of the entire rescue team, carry out extermination in the camp.
After the establishment of the camp, the logistics security team built 26 field tents of 4 types, such as command communication, equipment storage, medical cleaning, living accommodation and dog houses, to ensure more than 30 sets of rescue equipment on the ground.
Kim Jong-nam and his daughter have close father-daughter interactions, but his wife is left out in the cold.
（Combined report, September 11th） North Korea held a military parade on the 75th anniversary of the founding of the army on the evening of the 8th day of the month. The leader Kim Jong-un's daughter, Kim Yo-jong, not only attended the parade, but also stood on the podium with her father.
On the 9th day of the month, the Korean Central News Agency released a video showing Kim Jong-un hugging his father and talking to him in a low voice. She often looked at him with a loving gaze and touched his chest. The father-daughter interaction was broadcast throughout the country.
But Mrs. Li Xuezhong can only retreat to the sidelines.
According to reports from “Korean Central News Agency” and others, Kim Jong-nam and Ri Sol-ju were seen at an official photo of their daughter Kim Jung-a attending a banquet on July 7th. Kim Jung-a was not only rarely sitting in the middle C position with her parents but also joined Kim Jong-nam together with him on the podium for the military parade celebrating the 75th anniversary of建军节.
The Central Television of North Korea released the video of the parade after the event, revealing more scenes of father-daughter love.
Kim Jong-un and his daughter looked at each other several times from the podium, and their smiles never left their faces. They also whispered to each other in their ears, and Kim Jong-un once held his father's cheeks with both hands, and Kim Jong-un also smiled back.
Other official media footage also showed Kim's mother, Ai, touching her father's face while sitting on the sofa with Kim Jong-un in the living room; she was holding hands while walking with her father and touching Kim Jong-un's chest.
The first lady, Li Xue, was always behind or sitting in the side, and she was always a few steps away from her husband and daughter.
According to Korean media, since the first time he appeared in public after the launch of the first 17-rocket missile on November 18 last year, the exposure probability of Kim Jong-un has been increasing, and he has appeared five times in official occasions.
The official North Korean media used titles such as "my dearest son" and "my noble son" to refer to Kim Jong-un, and broadcast footage of Kim Jong-un repeatedly shouting his death oath to the white blooded while watching the parade from the stands.
These signs have raised doubts about whether Kim Jong-un has been predetermined as the heir to the Kim dynasty, and the Washington Post analysis said "this is a signal that Kim Jong-un is pushing his daughter to the position of the next leader at a young age." However, some opinions believe that it is too early to make such judgments, as there are various possibilities in the situation where Kim Jong-un has a son.
Xinhua Commentary: Promoting China’s modernization in the Chinese style is a systemic undertaking – Four Commentaries on Deeply Understanding President Xi Jinping's Speech at the Opening Session of the Seminar for Studying and Implementing the Spirit of the 20th CPC National Congress - CNTV
Xinhua News Agency, Beijing, February 11 (Zhang Ying) - The article is entitled: Promoting the Chinese Modernization is a Systematic Work - Four Thoughts on Deeply Understanding the Important Speech of General Secretary Xi Jinping at the Opening Ceremony of the Study Session on Learning and Implementing the Spirit of the 20th CPC National Congress
Xinhua News Agency commentator
The promotion of Chinese modernization is a systemic project that requires a combination of coordination, systematic planning, holistic promotion, and the correct handling of a number of important relationships such as top-level design and practice exploration, strategy and strategy, integrity and innovation, efficiency and fairness, vitality and order, self-reliance and openness.
At the opening session of the study class for new members of the Central Committee, alternate members, and main leaders at provincial and ministerial levels who have been newly admitted to the Central Committee, President Xi Jinping scientifically grasped the laws of modernization construction, deeply systematized and comprehensively expounded on a series of major relationships that need to be handled in practice, providing scientific methodology for us to accelerate China’s modernization.
The promotion of Chinese-style modernization involves all areas of the economy, politics, culture, society, ecological civilization, and other aspects of relations between the ruling party and the military, domestic and foreign affairs, and defense, and must be well planned, but also be courageous to reform and innovate, and continuously achieve overall progress.
To design at the top level, it is necessary to have a deep insight into the dynamics of world development, to accurately grasp the common aspirations of the masses of people, to explore in depth the laws of economic and social development, so that the planning and policy systems developed reflect the contemporary nature, the regularity of the system, the creativity, the close combination, the upstream and downstream content, and the coordination.
The promotion of Chinese-style modernization is an exploratory endeavor, and there are many unknown areas that need to be explored boldly in practice, and the promotion of the cause through reform and innovation should never be a matter of waiting for the sword or the stock.
Strategic issues are the fundamental issues of a political party and a country.
To advance Chinese-style modernization, to enhance the forward-looking nature of the strategy, to predict the future with scientific strategy, to lead the future; to enhance the holistic nature of the strategy, to focus on solving the major problems of the rise and fall of the party and the national cause, to move the whole body at once; to enhance the stability of the strategy, once the strategy is formed, it is necessary to persist in the long term, to grasp the bottom, to do good and do good.
To scientifically grasp the dialectical unity of strategy and tactics, integrate their principles with their flexibility, be flexible and adaptable, respond to changes in circumstances, and make decisions on the spot, seize opportunities, and gain strategic initiative in accordance with local conditions, situational considerations, and favorable trends.
The Chinese nation is a nation of upholding the right and innovation.
We must handle the relationship between upholding and innovating well, and ensure that we uphold the essence and source, the root and soul of China’s modernization, and ensure that China’s modernization is on the right track, while also putting innovation in a prominent position in the national development overall plan, responding to the requirements of the times, focusing on the major theoretical and practical issues, actively seeking changes and adjustments, and vigorously promoting reform and innovation, so as to continuously create new momentum and advantages for development, and fully unleash the creativity of the whole society.
Efficiency is an important foundation for fairness, and fairness is a powerful guarantee for efficiency.
We are advancing Chinese-style modernization to create a higher efficiency than capitalism and to maintain social equity more effectively, to achieve efficiency and equity in tandem, mutually promoting and united.
To deal with the efficient and equitable relationship, to constantly achieve development for the people, development by the people, and the results of development shared by the people, so that the results of modern construction benefit more and more equitably all people.
It is necessary to handle the relationship between vitality and order in the process of promoting social modernization in China, so that the society is full of vitality and orderly.
To effectively balance development and security, we must uphold the overall national security perspective, strengthen the national security system, enhance capabilities for maintaining national security, and resolutely safeguard state sovereignty, regime safety, ideological security, and the security of key areas.
In addition to taking greater account of security factors in development, enhancing national security strength through development and using development results to consolidate the foundations of national security, and creating a security environment conducive to economic and social development, it is also good at stimulating development dynamism and goodwill interaction to achieve high-quality development and a high level of security.
To advance China’s modernization model, we must both adhere to our own path and broaden our world perspective; we should also uphold openness to the outside world, continuously expanding the breadth and depth of China’s modernization model.
We must adhere to independent self-reliance, self-reliance, and strengthen the position of the country and the nation in our own strength, and firmly grasp the destiny of the development and progress of our country in our own hands.
To continuously expand the high level of opening up to the outside world, to participate deeply in the division of labor and cooperation in global industry, to use domestic and international resources to expand the development space of Chinese-style modernization, to share development opportunities in mutual benefit and win-win, and to create a bright future together.
The road is a long way to go.
Let us work together under the leadership of the Communist Party of China led by Xi Jinping and guided by the scientific thought of socialism with Chinese characteristics for a new era to grasp laws, persevere without slackening efforts, fully leverage our initiative, creativity, and dynamism, properly handle a series of major relationships, and make new contributions in the new journey toward building a modern socialist country in all respects. We will continue to open up new horizons for the path of Chinese-style modernization.
Together to resist the CPC, the US, Japan and the Philippines reached a consensus on defense
Asia - On February 9, Philippine President Bongbong Marcos visited Japan and met with Prime Minister Fumio Kishida.
The two sides agreed to oppose the Chinese invasion of the South China Sea and the East China Sea, and the leaders of the Philippines and Japan issued a joint statement after the meeting, saying that they would conduct substantial defense exchanges with the United States through the signing of a three-way defense agreement and oppose the hegemonic policy of the Chinese Communist Party.
According to Japanese media reports, Kishida hopes that this meeting will help Japan and the Philippines establish policies for dealing with the crisis in the Taiwan Strait.
Marcos of Malaca visited China in early January and signed an agreement worth $20 billion.
But since then, relations between China and the Philippines have not only not improved but have actually deteriorated.
Earlier this month, the Philippines signed an agreement with the United States to open more bases for the US military to ensure security in the South China Sea.
The newly added base is located 300 km from Taiwan and is also one of the closest to China.
If there is a crisis in Taiwan, US forces may launch operations from bases in the Philippines.
The Japanese media believe that now Japan, South Korea, Australia and even the Philippines are forming an axis with the US to build a bulwark in the Western Pacific against the Chinese-Chinese arcade to promote regional cooperation.
China encourages high fertility rates to get to universities and colleges to donate sperm
The China Human Sperm Bank in Yunnan Province has launched an advertisement to solicit donors with bachelor's degrees or higher education or students currently enrolled, offering a subsidy of RMB 4,500 for successful donations totaling eight to twelve cycles.
Taiwan media reported today that this message had risen to the top of Weibo’s hot search list and sparked initiatives from many provinces including Zhejiang, Shaanxi, Hubei, Shandong, and Beijing.
According to a report by the Free Times, China encourages university students to donate sperm.
The donor requirements for different universities are different. The donor requirements for Beijing University are the highest. In addition to the academic requirements, the donor must be taller than 1.70 meters, have a good appearance, no obvious hair loss, and the near vision degree cannot be higher than 600 degrees.
According to the report, the Human Sperm Library in Yunnan Province points out that sperm donors can get a complete set of male biopsies worth 1,000 yuan, especially semen and chromosome tests, which most people have never done, which is important for understanding their reproductive status.
The conditions for donation include being 165 cm or more tall, having a college degree or higher or being in school, having color blindness, having a genetic disorder such as hepatitis B and infectious diseases.
The report quotes a message from China’s Tianmu News that says there is an advertisement in the sperm bank of Shaanxi province which reads “donating sperm for money and infinite glory.” It calls on young people to donate their sperm and encourages netizens to forward related information so as to spread love.
The price in Shaanxi Province is higher than that in Yunnan Province. Qualified donors can receive RMB300 in cash each time, and those who have completed a certain number of donations can receive RMB5000.
The highest known subsidy is in Beijing, at 5,150 yuan.
“Fund E Account” comes: CSRC authorizes the development of a fund account that can aggregate and query all funds held in investors’ names - Ecns - China Economic Net - Professional website of financial news
Economic Observer reporter Chen Meng: The purchase channel of funds is complicated, which makes it difficult to collect account information.
Do you always forget your little treasure chest?
The problem of the Kisan people is about to be solved.
On February 10, the CSRC announced that the "fund E account" APP was launched for public trial operation in various mobile application stores.
It is reported that "Fund E Account" provides one-stop query services for individual investors to obtain information on public offering fund accounts and shares, aiming to address industry pain points such as forgetting account numbers and querying them in a cumbersome manner.
According to Wind data, as of the end of 2022, there were 156 public fund management companies in China, with a total of about 26 trillion yuan in fund management; 167 fund registration agencies and 411 fund sales agencies.
The accounting system of each registration institution is independent of each other, and there is no unified query channel in the industry.
Industry insiders said that at the end of 2021, there were more than 720 million fund investors in China, which means that half of the country's population invested in fund products.
Previously, investors needed to check the purchase situation through different sales channels, but through the "fund E account", they can check the purchase situation of all sales channels. The holding of funds is clear at a glance.
What is the "fund E account" app?
According to the relevant documents, the "Fund E Account" APP is a mobile application developed and built by China Clearing Co., Ltd. with the approval of the China Securities Regulatory Commission. It can provide one-stop query of the holdings of off-exchange public fund products for investors.
Investors can conveniently and quickly grasp the holdings of all fund products of all fund managers through the "Fund E account", which is a new channel for investors to check their holdings of fund products through all sales channels. This will greatly improve the query efficiency.
Specifically, investors can query information about their fund accounts through the “Fund E Account,” including account information for funds opened at all public mutual fund managers and trading accounts opened at public fund sales institutions, as well as holdings of products such as open-end securities investment funds and collective asset management plans that do not have an upper limit on the number of investors.
The Shanghai Securities Fund Evaluation Research Center business manager, Liu Yiqiu told Economic Watch Network reporters that investors can get a one-stop-shop information about all their holdings of OTC funds through the OTC fund E Account OTC App, which helps them find the forgotten asset pairs, and more importantly, the complete account information summary of the integrated fund investment situation for clients, which helps clients to better understand their investment situation in a timely, accurate and complete manner, thus better optimizing their portfolio fund configuration and better planning their financial arrangements.
How to register and use?
Reporters noticed that the "Fund E Account" APP has been listed in the app stores of Huawei, Apple, Xiaomi, OPPO, and vivo, but the APP is still in the trial operation stage. Investors can register by filling in the invitation code and can contact the fund management company that holds the fund to obtain the invitation code.
A customer service representative of a large public fund in Shanghai provided a 6-digit invitation code to the Economic Observer reporter and told the reporter, "During the trial operation of the APP, China Clearing provided a certain number of invitation codes to each fund management company. Investors can call to obtain them. We will provide them to investors.
After the trial run, the invitation code will no longer be used for open user registration.
Translation requested.
The reporter registered and used the account according to the "Account of Fund E" download and use instructions on the official website of the CSRC, and the whole process only took a few minutes. It mainly consists of four steps: user registration, real name verification, fund account binding, and public fund query.
After verifying the identity, click the "Assets" button to bind the fund, and all the funds purchased through various fund sales platforms will be displayed in the list of binding options (can be bound to the account). After binding, you can see the total assets of the fund and can start using the query function.
It is worth noting that the "Fund E Account" only provides query services to investors, and cannot conduct redemption and repurchase.
The data displayed in the "Fund E account" is generally the date of the user's query (T day) forwarded by three trading days.
For example, on February 10th, when you open the "Fund E Account," the total assets, fund shares, and net asset value displayed under the Asset page correspond to the date three trading days prior to that, which is February 7th.
