2 Then in the middle you contact the customer service, they will tell you that the problem will be handled by a commissioner, who will inform you of the result.
You will never be able to contact this specialist, and you don't know her work number, and you don't have a direct dialing number, so you can't contact her, but only she can contact you.
Tragedy is that I waited for nearly three days, and this official called me; however, my phone was away from me for a while, so I did not receive his call.
I waited for two hours without getting that specialist's call; I then contacted Amazon customer service and sent an email to them asking her to call me back.
