It is said to be leather, but it is actually quite hard. However, if you look carefully, there are many fine cracks on it. It is not clear whether it is real leather. The sleeves of this jacket are really incomprehensible. Normally, the sleeves of a jacket are longer than the garment itself, but they are usually only 1-2 cm long. This jacket is 5 cm long, which should be at the wrist joint. However, the sleeves of this jacket are covering the fingers.
It's an en-dash!
Amazon pictures are in italics, and the results sent to me are in italics, isn't that cheating?
The worst online shopping experience
After placing the order on September 28, the system showed that the goods had been shipped, but I did not receive the goods until October 12.
I checked Amazon order status, seller did not provide express delivery number, I could not find where the order is.
So I sent an email to the seller asking if they could provide a delivery number, but there was no reply after two days.
I was helpless, so I called Amazon customer service, and the customer service told me the seller's phone number. I called the seller again and again, and finally, the phone was connected. The seller told me that the package was lost, and I could re-send it to me immediately.
Although I was very angry, since the computer urgently needed it, I didn't say much to the seller and just wanted them to send it immediately.
The next day, I called to check if the order had been shipped.
The seller says not yet; it will be delivered later in the afternoon.
I called again this afternoon to ask, but the seller said it would definitely be sent; they promised to ship after 5 or 6 PM in the afternoon. However, when I called at 7 PM, no one answered the phone.
I called again the next morning and asked if the package had been sent out.
Can you tell me the order number?
The seller said that he didn't send it, and told me to order from other places if I was in a hurry, but if I could wait until the afternoon, he would send it.
I can't, I have to wait for a long time to order from other places.
The only thing you can do is ask the seller to send the goods quickly.
Finally, after countless phone calls, I received my computer on October 16.
As for the quality of the computer, I don't know, because it was bought for someone else, so I will add a comment later.
The fake is especially powerful
I'm also addicted to Amazon selling fake products.
The customer service said that since I used it, I cannot return it, so I don't know if it is fake.
I'm not sure if I'm going to buy it because I trust you, so I'm sad, after all it's a face covering, really go to the physical store and buy it, it's a bit expensive.
Because it's a flash sale, I didn't read the reviews; I've submitted my complaint to the National Administration for Industry and Commerce on behalf of the e-commerce platform we all use. Let's join forces in our fight!
