I have been eyeing this camera for a long time, but I didn't buy it because of the price and other reasons. This time, I bought it because of the free shipping and the price is still acceptable.
After I bought it, there were no problems with other things, but when I connected the software, I couldn't connect it. My router is TP, and I searched the Internet and found that many people had this problem. I spent two hours to change the settings of the router, and finally I used 360WIFI as a medium to make it work. I called the Mi customer service and they didn't have any solutions to this problem. They just told me to contact Amazon for after-sales service.
Another point to note is that I have seen user comments online stating that this camera supports the smallest storage card of 8GB; any smaller and it will not be recognized, so please pay attention to this issue.
It's ok to use, the picture is ok, but the sound quality is very bad, the machine has a certain degree of heat, if it is always on, the heat of this degree is a little difficult to accept.
In conclusion, this product has many shortcomings, so please be careful when you buy it.
